Does anybody have a widget or routines, preferably PERL, for interfacing 
an application to the HTPP CONVER server?

I'd like to tie our local chat channel to APRS.

For example.

Messages on CONVER channel 14646 get broadcast from the local APRS 
server.   Likewise, sending an APRS message to some alias such as C14646 
would have the server forwarding it to CONVER channel 14646.

